 "title": "Work Horse | Cabinets | $125 per Opening | Script 2",
 "source": "Notion: SCRIPT 2: CABINET PAINTING — Work Horse (Winner, $45.47 CPL). Seasonal wording removed (\"this New Year\", \"in 2026\", \"New Year Pricing\"); 1-year craftsmanship warranty per client revision 2026-01-10.",
 "vo": {
